{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03690",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 3.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Hello, sorry about the delay, do sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.43,
      "end_seconds": 10.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Uh, you know, hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.07,
      "end_seconds": 17.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "how are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.05,
      "end_seconds": 31.13,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "Actually, mainly a dry cough. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.79,
      "end_seconds": 37.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.93,
      "end_seconds": 50.54,
      "duration_seconds": 9.61,
      "text": "It's been going on for two months. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.29,
      "end_seconds": 61.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.29,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.55,
      "end_seconds": 69.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "Honestly, every other day. Mild, really. I've also had sore ankles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.34,
      "end_seconds": 74.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.34,
      "end_seconds": 83.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.1,
      "end_seconds": 109.19,
      "duration_seconds": 11.09,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 128 over 81, respiratory rate 18, temp 36.7 degrees. And SpO2 97 percent on room air, heart rate 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.78,
      "end_seconds": 115.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "okay, time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.65,
      "end_seconds": 117.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.41,
      "end_seconds": 121.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Okay, look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.77,
      "end_seconds": 145.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "There are tender raised red nodules on both shins and your ankles are puffy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.97,
      "end_seconds": 148.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.02,
      "end_seconds": 158.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Did you get fever, coughing up blood, night sweats or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.33,
      "end_seconds": 163.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "None of those, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.76,
      "end_seconds": 168.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.0,
      "end_seconds": 171.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.73,
      "end_seconds": 189.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.39,
      "end_seconds": 193.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.67,
      "end_seconds": 195.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.73,
      "end_seconds": 202.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.1,
      "end_seconds": 205.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.82,
      "end_seconds": 210.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.48,
      "end_seconds": 214.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.42,
      "end_seconds": 220.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.0,
      "end_seconds": 223.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "how are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.69,
      "end_seconds": 228.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.81,
      "end_seconds": 239.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.45,
      "end_seconds": 244.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "I have eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.13,
      "end_seconds": 249.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Ah. Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.5,
      "end_seconds": 257.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream. I take it when needed for the eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.87,
      "end_seconds": 260.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.03,
      "end_seconds": 263.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "About two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.48,
      "end_seconds": 270.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.82,
      "end_seconds": 277.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "I mean, I don't think I have any, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.21,
      "end_seconds": 287.29,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I don't have a clear answer today: possible sarcoidosis is possible, and so is tuberculosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.77,
      "end_seconds": 300.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Blood tests is what I'd like next, for possible sarcoidosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.76,
      "end_seconds": 303.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.36,
      "end_seconds": 335.94,
      "duration_seconds": 30.58,
      "text": "I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for cough and erythema nodosum. Rest and elevate the legs, and I'm arranging a chest clinic review. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. The respiratory clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you. Let's plan a check after the tests. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.84,
      "end_seconds": 340.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.02,
      "end_seconds": 342.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "take care now"
    }
  ]
}